#: ../../library/imu.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`imu` --- IMU helper for the Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense"
msgstr ":mod:`imu` --- pomocník IMU pro Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense"

#: ../../library/imu.rst:10
msgid ""
"This page documents the Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense's Python ``imu`` module (a"
" small wrapper around the on-board IMU drivers). For the OpenMV C-level "
"``imu`` module that ships on the OPENMV_N6, OPENMV_RT1060, and OPENMV_AE3 "
"camera boards, see :doc:`omv.imu`."
msgstr ""
"Tato stránka dokumentuje Python modul ``imu`` desky Arduino Nano 33 BLE "
"Sense (malý obal nad ovladači palubní IMU). Pro modul ``imu`` na úrovni "
"jazyka C od OpenMV, který je dodáván na kamerách OPENMV_N6, OPENMV_RT1060 a "
"OPENMV_AE3, viz :doc:`omv.imu`\\ ."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:15
msgid ""
"This module is a thin board-specific wrapper that exposes the on-board "
"inertial measurement unit of the Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense as a single "
":py:class:`~imu.IMU` object. Both hardware revisions of the board are "
"handled transparently:"
msgstr ""
"Tento modul je tenký obal specifický pro desku, který zpřístupňuje palubní "
"inerciální měřicí jednotku desky Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense jako jediný "
"objekt :py:class:`~imu.IMU`\\ . Obě hardwarové revize desky jsou obsluhovány"
" transparentně:"

#: ../../library/imu.rst:20
msgid "**Rev 1** uses a single LSM9DS1 9-axis IMU."
msgstr "**Rev 1** používá jedinou 9osou IMU LSM9DS1."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Rev 2** combines a Bosch BMI270 (accelerometer + gyroscope) with a Bosch "
"BMM150 magnetometer."
msgstr ""
"**Rev 2** kombinuje Bosch BMI270 (akcelerometr + gyroskop) s magnetometrem "
"Bosch BMM150."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:24
msgid ""
"The constructor probes the I2C bus for the BMI270 address (``0x68``) and "
"selects the matching driver automatically, so user code can be written once "
"and run on either revision."
msgstr ""
"Konstruktor prozkoumá I2C sběrnici na adresu BMI270 (\\ ``0x68``\\ ) a "
"automaticky vybere odpovídající ovladač, takže uživatelský kód lze napsat "
"jednou a spustit na kterékoli revizi."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:28
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Příklad::"

#: ../../library/imu.rst:45
msgid "class IMU"
msgstr "class IMU"

#: ../../library/imu.rst:49
msgid "Construct an IMU object bound to an I2C bus."
msgstr "Vytvoří objekt IMU navázaný na I2C sběrnici."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:51
msgid ""
"*bus* is an initialised :py:class:`machine.I2C` instance connected to the "
"on-board IMU(s)."
msgstr ""
"*bus* je inicializovaná instance :py:class:`machine.I2C` připojená k "
"palubním IMU."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:54
msgid ""
"On construction the bus is scanned: if a device responds at address ``0x68``"
" a `BMI270` plus `BMM150` pair is instantiated (Nano 33 BLE Sense Rev 2), "
"otherwise an `LSM9DS1` is instantiated (Rev 1). The underlying driver is "
"kept on the ``imu`` attribute and configured with default ranges and output "
"data rates."
msgstr ""
"Při konstrukci se sběrnice naskenuje: pokud zařízení odpoví na adrese "
"``0x68``\\ , vytvoří se dvojice `BMI270` a `BMM150` (Nano 33 BLE Sense Rev "
"2), jinak se vytvoří `LSM9DS1` (Rev 1). Základní ovladač je uchováván v "
"atributu ``imu`` a nakonfigurován s výchozími rozsahy a výstupními datovými "
"rychlostmi."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:62
msgid ""
"Return the latest accelerometer reading as an ``(x, y, z)`` tuple in units "
"of *g* (standard gravities)."
msgstr ""
"Vrátí poslední hodnotu z akcelerometru jako n-tici ``(x, y, z)`` v "
"jednotkách *g* (standardní tíhová zrychlení)."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:67
msgid ""
"Return the latest gyroscope reading as an ``(x, y, z)`` tuple in degrees per"
" second."
msgstr ""
"Vrátí poslední hodnotu z gyroskopu jako n-tici ``(x, y, z)`` ve stupních za "
"sekundu."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:72
msgid ""
"Return the latest magnetometer reading as an ``(x, y, z)`` tuple in micro-"
"tesla (uT)."
msgstr ""
"Vrátí poslední hodnotu z magnetometru jako n-tici ``(x, y, z)`` v "
"mikroteslech (uT)."
